    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, a heart infection?? thats scary. i mean i feel okay when i'm just sitting on the couch, it's really only when i'm moving around a bit. do you think it's possible it's just my body still fighting the virus? i've been taking a bunch of extra vitamins and electrolytes to help with the exhaustion, maybe i just need more time to recover?",
