      "content": "idk i just dont want to go to the er for nothing... it feels so dramatic. if i just take some ibuprofen to help with the chest tightness and keep resting, do you think that would be enough to get through the week? i'm really hoping it's just inflammation from the flu that'll go away on its own.",
